# Manual orchestration (no selected workflow)

This workspace was created with --no-workflow. It has no selected workflow, no
phase and no workflow template digest. There is no workflow to advance or release
to confirm.

Coordinate work manually: create explicit tasks with acceptance criteria and
dependencies, create agents and worktrees, start worker sessions, and track the
result through messages, handoffs, checks and acceptance. Ordinary lifecycle
control (pause and resume) and runtime reconciliation remain available.

Do not select a workflow for this workspace and do not treat process exit or
handoff acceptance as workspace completion.
